# Setup's LACE MODES (GLO's list, the FM-1's own setting: CPU, LACE MODES): 12 (all) by default, then 10, 8, 6 (the
# highest modes left out, the level kept: lc_prep); four lace notes rendered at 12 and at 8 (full.wav, eight.wav, their
# levels within a dB or two); kept over a restart
wait 300
preset 3 lace lace
notes 3 1 1 4 100 C4
notes 3 1 5 4 100 E4
notes 3 1 9 4 100 G4
notes 3 1 13 4 100 C5
listen
tap GLO
turn SELECT 8
expect page Setup
tap SEL
wait 100
row LACE MODES
expect rowval LACE_MODES 12_(all)
wav full.wav
tap PLAY
bars 1
tap PLAY
wavstop
spin ALGO 1
wait 50
spin ALGO 1
wait 50
said LACE MODES
expect rowval LACE_MODES 8
wav eight.wav
tap PLAY
bars 1
tap PLAY
wavstop
spin ALGO 1
wait 50
spin ALGO 1
wait 50
expect rowval LACE_MODES 6
spin ALGO -1
wait 50
expect rowval LACE_MODES 8
tap SEL
tap SAVE
wait 300
reboot
wait 300
tap GLO
turn SELECT 8
tap SEL
wait 100
row LACE MODES
expect rowval LACE_MODES 8
